Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.20,0:00:00.87,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（機器人）
Dialogue: 2,0:00:01.12,0:00:02.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,歡迎來訪
Dialogue: 2,0:00:04.42,0:00:06.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿… 爾瑪？
Dialogue: 2,0:00:06.15,0:00:08.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,今天怎麼變小隻了？
Dialogue: 2,0:00:09.32,0:00:11.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,唉呀 瑪琪娜
Dialogue: 2,0:00:11.60,0:00:12.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,喔！
Dialogue: 2,0:00:12.55,0:00:15.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,瑪琪娜 對學姊要說“妳好”才行
Dialogue: 2,0:00:15.50,0:00:16.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,妳好！
Dialogue: 2,0:00:16.92,0:00:18.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,瑪琪娜好乖喔
Dialogue: 2,0:00:20.30,0:00:22.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,學姊 阿爾瑪這是？
Dialogue: 2,0:00:22.75,0:00:26.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,最近不是跑去宇宙\N還有遇到了很多事嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:00:26.80,0:00:29.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對阿爾瑪的身體造成了不小的負擔
Dialogue: 2,0:00:30.25,0:00:33.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,安全起見正在全面檢修喔
Dialogue: 2,0:00:34.57,0:00:37.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這期間讓她沒有身體也有點可憐
Dialogue: 2,0:00:38.37,0:00:41.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,所以… 備用軀體阿爾瑪S型！
Dialogue: 2,0:00:41.70,0:00:42.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,最佳方案！
Dialogue: 2,0:00:43.37,0:00:45.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,處理能力減少八成
Dialogue: 2,0:00:45.87,0:00:49.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,身體條件也跟普通小孩差不多
Dialogue: 2,0:00:49.22,0:00:50.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 2,0:00:50.27,0:00:51.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好小喔
Dialogue: 2,0:00:51.90,0:00:55.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,而且阿爾瑪S有一個問題
Dialogue: 2,0:00:55.70,0:00:57.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,變弱了真是辛苦啊
Dialogue: 2,0:00:58.55,0:00:59.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,還能發射光束
Dialogue: 2,0:01:05.67,0:01:09.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啊 不知不覺就盯著看 檢修就…
Dialogue: 2,0:01:09.75,0:01:10.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,很有學姊的風格呢
Dialogue: 2,0:01:11.30,0:01:13.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,請務必讓我幫忙
Dialogue: 2,0:01:13.95,0:01:17.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,絕對比那男人還有用喔！
Dialogue: 2,0:01:17.22,0:01:20.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這樣啊… 那到我的實驗室來吧
Dialogue: 2,0:01:20.25,0:01:21.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好的！
Dialogue: 2,0:01:23.95,0:01:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿咻
Dialogue: 2,0:01:26.62,0:01:28.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,進來吧
Dialogue: 2,0:01:28.25,0:01:31.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,哈啊啊 和小雀學姊一起上廁所
Dialogue: 2,0:01:33.05,0:01:35.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我沒預想過這這種情境
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.50,0:01:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（阿爾瑪醬想成為家人）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.80,0:03:16.42,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（“朋友”）
Dialogue: 2,0:03:13.97,0:03:16.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這就是學姊的實驗室
Dialogue: 2,0:03:20.55,0:03:21.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不過…
Dialogue: 2,0:03:21.47,0:03:24.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,公寓下面竟然有這種實驗室
Dialogue: 2,0:03:24.82,0:03:26.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,如果在上面工作
Dialogue: 2,0:03:26.95,0:03:29.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,噪音之類的問題總是不斷有人抱怨
Dialogue: 2,0:03:29.60,0:03:32.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,欸 好多看起來很強的欸
Dialogue: 2,0:03:32.75,0:03:35.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是開發阿爾瑪時做的軀體
Dialogue: 2,0:03:35.95,0:03:37.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,完成我們之前
Dialogue: 2,0:03:37.67,0:03:39.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,居然有過那麼多種身體呢
Dialogue: 2,0:03:41.42,0:03:44.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,喔 媽媽 這個！
Dialogue: 2,0:03:44.85,0:03:47.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這也是備用軀體
Dialogue: 2,0:03:47.37,0:03:48.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,要用看看嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:03:48.80,0:03:49.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 2,0:03:52.72,0:03:54.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,資料同步完成
Dialogue: 2,0:03:58.52,0:04:02.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是太耗能量而被淘汰的阿爾瑪JK喔
Dialogue: 2,0:04:06.50,0:04:08.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,身體好沉重
Dialogue: 2,0:04:08.57,0:04:11.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,因為處理能力依然很低啊
Dialogue: 2,0:04:11.87,0:04:13.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這是誰的制服？
Dialogue: 2,0:04:14.30,0:04:16.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我高中的舊衣服
Dialogue: 2,0:04:17.10,0:04:19.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我的衣服也是常常的舊衣服喔
Dialogue: 2,0:04:19.80,0:04:21.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,笨蛋 這有什麼好比的
Dialogue: 2,0:04:22.05,0:04:23.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但是好好喔
Dialogue: 2,0:04:23.32,0:04:23.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好大！
Dialogue: 2,0:04:24.27,0:04:25.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,感覺很強！
Dialogue: 2,0:04:25.35,0:04:26.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,某方面來說是沒錯啦
Dialogue: 2,0:04:26.97,0:04:29.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪 換我吧
Dialogue: 2,0:04:29.52,0:04:30.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沒問題
Dialogue: 2,0:04:32.80,0:04:34.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,常常！怎樣呀！
Dialogue: 2,0:04:35.37,0:04:37.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好啦 很可愛很可愛
Dialogue: 2,0:04:37.67,0:04:38.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好耶！
Dialogue: 2,0:04:38.85,0:04:41.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,瑪琪娜 還回來
Dialogue: 2,0:04:42.72,0:04:44.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,唉 結束了嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:04:44.85,0:04:47.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪 好可愛喔
Dialogue: 2,0:04:47.62,0:04:49.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,再讓我換一次嘛！
Dialogue: 2,0:04:49.85,0:04:50.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,可以喔
Dialogue: 2,0:04:52.07,0:04:54.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那每30秒就交換吧
Dialogue: 2,0:04:55.12,0:04:57.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,學姊… 換上制服吧
Dialogue: 2,0:04:57.62,0:04:58.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 2,0:04:58.72,0:05:03.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,7 6 5 4 3…
Dialogue: 2,0:05:04.45,0:05:05.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,30秒到了！
Dialogue: 2,0:05:06.12,0:05:07.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,妳快了一秒
Dialogue: 2,0:05:07.87,0:05:09.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你真愛計較！
Dialogue: 2,0:05:09.47,0:05:11.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,一秒就是一秒
Dialogue: 2,0:05:12.05,0:05:14.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好棒喔 就像真正的姊妹呢
Dialogue: 2,0:05:17.97,0:05:19.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 2,0:05:19.67,0:05:21.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真是 她們又來啦
Dialogue: 2,0:05:23.00,0:05:25.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,得讓阿爾瑪盡量…
Dialogue: 2,0:05:25.32,0:05:26.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不被瑪琪娜影響才行… 喔！
Dialogue: 2,0:05:27.30,0:05:28.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你回來了
Dialogue: 2,0:05:28.52,0:05:29.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,搞什麼？
Dialogue: 2,0:05:29.90,0:05:31.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,原來兩人一起使用就好了呢
Dialogue: 2,0:05:32.17,0:05:33.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,抱歉呀阿爾瑪
Dialogue: 2,0:05:33.95,0:05:34.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我才是
Dialogue: 2,0:05:35.30,0:05:38.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,唉… 這對心臟不好啊
Dialogue: 2,0:05:40.60,0:05:42.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,妳怎麼穿這樣啊！
Dialogue: 2,0:05:42.42,0:05:43.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沒禮貌
Dialogue: 2,0:05:43.70,0:05:46.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,因為常夜說無論如何都想…
Dialogue: 2,0:05:46.57,0:05:50.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,學姊 太棒啦 超美的！
Dialogue: 2,0:05:50.60,0:05:52.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,妳們是在幹嘛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.57,0:06:01.45,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（今天的阿爾瑪報告）
Dialogue: 2,0:05:56.42,0:05:58.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,全面檢修 充滿活力
Dialogue: 2,0:05:59.20,0:06:00.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,完全恢復
Dialogue: 2,0:06:02.37,0:06:04.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,暫稱“少女型武器”
Dialogue: 2,0:06:05.50,0:06:09.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,各國監視衛星都已偵測到的未知物體
Dialogue: 2,0:06:10.37,0:06:13.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好想要… 怎樣都想要
Dialogue: 2,0:06:18.15,0:06:20.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,要出發囉 田中
Dialogue: 2,0:06:22.90,0:06:24.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,去日本！
Dialogue: 2,0:06:24.57,0:06:26.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啊 那是什麼？
Dialogue: 2,0:06:31.45,0:06:32.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,失控的無人機！
Dialogue: 2,0:06:59.05,0:07:00.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,已執行強制重新啟動
Dialogue: 2,0:07:01.37,0:07:02.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,已經沒事了喔
Dialogue: 2,0:07:06.15,0:07:07.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,工作請加油
Dialogue: 2,0:07:13.25,0:07:16.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,遠超過我預料的美貌
Dialogue: 2,0:07:18.85,0:07:22.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不愧是“少女型武器”呢
Dialogue: 2,0:07:31.32,0:07:32.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,得回家了
Dialogue: 2,0:07:32.62,0:07:34.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,咦？等一下
Dialogue: 2,0:07:34.80,0:07:37.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是妳！就是在說妳喔！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:37.47,0:07:40.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,飛在半空中的妳！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:41.25,0:07:42.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:42.45,0:07:43.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我是阿爾瑪
Dialogue: 2,0:07:46.50,0:07:51.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,突然就掌控了主導權… 真行啊
Dialogue: 2,0:07:53.67,0:07:58.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我是妮恩沃茲尼亞克
Dialogue: 2,0:07:59.25,0:08:01.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沃茲尼亞克
Dialogue: 2,0:08:01.25,0:08:03.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那家世界頂尖的軍工複合體
Dialogue: 2,0:08:04.20,0:08:06.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,“沃茲尼亞克電子”嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:08:06.90,0:08:09.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,承蒙厚愛 深感光榮
Dialogue: 2,0:08:09.92,0:08:12.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,從奶瓶到飛彈
Dialogue: 2,0:08:12.17,0:08:15.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我註定終要繼承那間公司
Dialogue: 2,0:08:16.10,0:08:17.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我就直說了吧
Dialogue: 2,0:08:17.97,0:08:18.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪
Dialogue: 2,0:08:19.50,0:08:22.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,要不要和我們公司簽約呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:08:23.00,0:08:27.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,妳作為戰鬥兵器\N擁有無與倫比的商品價值
Dialogue: 2,0:08:29.30,0:08:30.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那是在幹嘛
Dialogue: 2,0:08:31.25,0:08:35.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,蘊藏在妳小小軀體中的無限可能性
Dialogue: 2,0:08:35.37,0:08:37.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,能加以活用的只有我們公司
Dialogue: 2,0:08:38.42,0:08:41.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,當然會為妳準備最好的待遇！
Dialogue: 2,0:08:41.55,0:08:43.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但是我不是武器喔
Dialogue: 2,0:08:44.30,0:08:45.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,怎麼會呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:08:45.92,0:08:47.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,妳不是發射了光束嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:08:48.57,0:08:50.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,說是出於興趣才裝的
Dialogue: 2,0:08:51.20,0:08:54.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那到目前為止\N妳不曾用盡全力是嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:08:55.37,0:08:56.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,幾乎沒有
Dialogue: 2,0:08:58.60,0:08:59.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 2,0:09:11.65,0:09:16.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,妳完全不懂自己的魅力呢
Dialogue: 2,0:09:20.37,0:09:22.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,日本的各位
Dialogue: 2,0:09:22.90,0:09:26.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,再來要將沃茲尼亞克的\N新型護衛機器人
Dialogue: 2,0:09:26.20,0:09:28.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,為各位示範操作！
Dialogue: 2,0:09:29.07,0:09:33.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,請退到封鎖線之外！
Dialogue: 2,0:09:35.67,0:09:39.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,就由我！來將您潛藏的魅力！
Dialogue: 2,0:09:40.50,0:09:44.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,機體耐力沒問題 對書包的\N負荷較高
Dialogue: 2,0:09:44.75,0:09:47.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,更加徹底地激發出來吧！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:02.15,0:10:05.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,來吧！展現妳所有的實力吧！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:05.77,0:10:09.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我會展現能接納一切的本事的！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:09.50,0:10:10.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:21.60,0:10:25.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪之拳！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:28.42,0:10:31.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,怎麼回事啊
Dialogue: 2,0:10:31.82,0:10:34.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,妳果然是… 最棒的
Dialogue: 2,0:10:41.60,0:10:43.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪
Dialogue: 2,0:10:45.87,0:10:48.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,偵測到超驚人的能量在上升！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:49.55,0:10:51.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,爸爸 媽媽
Dialogue: 2,0:10:51.85,0:10:53.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沒… 沒事吧
Dialogue: 2,0:10:54.47,0:10:57.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,爹地… 媽咪？
Dialogue: 2,0:10:58.00,0:10:58.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 2,0:11:01.60,0:11:04.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對我來說現在最重要的是
Dialogue: 2,0:11:05.30,0:11:08.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,作為爸爸和媽媽的女兒生活
Dialogue: 2,0:11:13.55,0:11:15.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我明白了
Dialogue: 2,0:11:15.80,0:11:17.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,妳的目的是什麼！
Dialogue: 2,0:11:18.05,0:11:19.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,亮出那種東西
Dialogue: 2,0:11:19.47,0:11:21.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是想對阿爾瑪做什麼？
Dialogue: 2,0:11:24.10,0:11:26.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,請把女兒交給我吧！
Dialogue: 2,0:11:30.42,0:11:34.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我聽說在日本要這樣跟雙親問候
Dialogue: 2,0:11:34.52,0:11:36.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是有這種狀況沒錯啦
Dialogue: 2,0:11:37.17,0:11:39.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我從第一眼看到阿爾瑪
Dialogue: 2,0:11:39.67,0:11:43.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那優雅的姿態 壓倒性的威力
Dialogue: 2,0:11:43.87,0:11:46.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,比人類還惹人憐愛的舉止
Dialogue: 2,0:11:46.65,0:11:49.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,她的一切深深吸引了我
Dialogue: 2,0:11:49.77,0:11:52.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,呵呵呵… 妳很懂嘛
Dialogue: 2,0:11:52.85,0:11:56.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,呵呵呵… 看來妳挺識貨的嘛
Dialogue: 2,0:11:56.57,0:12:01.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但既然雙親仍健在\N遵循禮節才有道理
Dialogue: 2,0:12:04.50,0:12:06.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我當然不敢要求免費！
Dialogue: 2,0:12:07.30,0:12:09.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我會依你們三人的開價一起雇用的！
Dialogue: 2,0:12:09.97,0:12:11.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這條件絕對不差吧
Dialogue: 2,0:12:12.57,0:12:15.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我大概了解妳的意思了
Dialogue: 2,0:12:15.67,0:12:16.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那麼…
Dialogue: 2,0:12:16.60,0:12:17.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不會把女兒給妳
Dialogue: 2,0:12:17.65,0:12:19.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,為什麼呀？
Dialogue: 2,0:12:19.40,0:12:21.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,錢！錢！錢！
Dialogue: 2,0:12:21.25,0:12:22.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,大公司就是這樣！
Dialogue: 2,0:12:23.00,0:12:26.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對小孩子認真什麼啊 真是的
Dialogue: 2,0:12:27.17,0:12:28.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,爸爸 怎麼這樣！
Dialogue: 2,0:12:29.17,0:12:30.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,誰是妳爸啊！
Dialogue: 2,0:12:31.77,0:12:32.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,妮恩…
Dialogue: 2,0:12:32.67,0:12:33.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪
Dialogue: 2,0:12:34.90,0:12:38.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,因為這樣 我無法成為妮恩的東西
Dialogue: 2,0:12:39.30,0:12:42.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但和妮恩一起玩很開心喔！
Dialogue: 2,0:12:42.75,0:12:44.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,所以首先…
Dialogue: 2,0:12:44.72,0:12:46.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,就從當朋友開始吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:12:47.25,0:12:49.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,當… 當然好啊！
Dialogue: 2,0:12:50.00,0:12:52.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,-我家小姐就是這個樣子\N-我們是朋友了呢！哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 2,0:12:52.40,0:12:55.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,-因為之前沒有交過朋友\N-嗯 請多指教
Dialogue: 2,0:12:55.47,0:12:56.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,請多指教
Dialogue: 2,0:13:06.55,0:13:08.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,妮恩14歲了
Dialogue: 2,0:13:09.27,0:13:10.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是國中生對吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:13:11.17,0:13:12.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,然後呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:13:12.80,0:13:14.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這裡是小學喔
Dialogue: 2,0:13:16.92,0:13:18.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我是反向跳級！
Dialogue: 2,0:13:18.55,0:13:21.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,友情是超越一切的存在喔！
Dialogue: 2,0:13:21.87,0:13:23.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,友情真強啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.27,0:13:29.52,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（今天的阿爾瑪報告）
Dialogue: 2,0:13:24.52,0:13:26.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,結交了新朋友
Dialogue: 2,0:13:26.80,0:13:29.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,能交到100人嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:13:31.25,0:13:32.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,哈啾
Dialogue: 2,0:13:32.50,0:13:35.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,發燒 咳嗽 打噴嚏這類症狀
Dialogue: 2,0:13:36.42,0:13:37.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是感冒呢
Dialogue: 2,0:13:37.72,0:13:42.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗚… 今天睡上一天就會好了吧
Dialogue: 2,0:13:42.35,0:13:45.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,搞什麼… 竟然會得夏季感冒
Dialogue: 2,0:13:45.80,0:13:47.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沒做好自我管理喔
Dialogue: 2,0:13:47.35,0:13:49.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你說什麼
Dialogue: 2,0:13:50.15,0:13:51.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪在擔心妳喔？
Dialogue: 2,0:13:53.87,0:13:55.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是說這就麻煩了
Dialogue: 2,0:13:55.77,0:13:58.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,今天的委託工作要忙到深夜…
Dialogue: 2,0:13:59.17,0:14:00.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,爸爸！
Dialogue: 2,0:14:01.42,0:14:05.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我只要學習就能做到全面治療！
Dialogue: 2,0:14:06.02,0:14:08.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,爸爸去忙工作吧
Dialogue: 2,0:14:08.80,0:14:10.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這… 這樣啊
Dialogue: 2,0:14:11.00,0:14:13.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪 那就交給妳了
Dialogue: 2,0:14:13.77,0:14:15.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我會盡量提早回來的
Dialogue: 2,0:14:19.12,0:14:20.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,責任重大
Dialogue: 2,0:14:24.40,0:14:25.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,選擇模式
Dialogue: 2,0:14:35.37,0:14:39.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪護理師模式 看護就交給我吧
Dialogue: 2,0:14:40.37,0:14:42.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,強制連線網路
Dialogue: 2,0:14:43.42,0:14:45.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,取得各種醫療資料
Dialogue: 2,0:14:45.50,0:14:47.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,修補完成
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.30,0:14:51.37,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（數位微孔成像儀）
Dialogue: 2,0:14:47.52,0:14:51.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,退熱貼、營養補充品
Dialogue: 2,0:14:51.80,0:14:55.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,指示製作病患飲食 分配家事
Dialogue: 2,0:14:55.67,0:14:57.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,擦汗 換衣服 喝水
Dialogue: 2,0:14:58.50,0:15:01.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,已做完所有可行的措施
Dialogue: 2,0:15:01.75,0:15:03.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這樣病情應該會好轉
Dialogue: 2,0:15:04.70,0:15:05.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,謝謝妳
Dialogue: 2,0:15:18.55,0:15:20.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,妳在幹嘛？
Dialogue: 2,0:15:20.52,0:15:23.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,明明做了所有措施 但媽媽沒有痊癒
Dialogue: 2,0:15:24.35,0:15:28.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,感冒是不會立刻痊癒的… 謝謝妳
Dialogue: 2,0:15:31.75,0:15:33.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,追加搜尋醫療資料
Dialogue: 2,0:15:35.60,0:15:39.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,強制存取違法資料和違法網站的資料
Dialogue: 2,0:15:40.77,0:15:43.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好像沒有立刻見效的方法
Dialogue: 2,0:15:44.37,0:15:46.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,其他的有用資訊來源…
Dialogue: 2,0:15:47.92,0:15:50.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,照顧生病的媽媽
Dialogue: 2,0:15:50.45,0:15:52.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好乖啊
Dialogue: 2,0:15:52.42,0:15:55.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但是阿爾瑪怎麼變好小？
Dialogue: 2,0:15:55.97,0:15:58.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,因為不能離開媽媽
Dialogue: 2,0:15:58.42,0:15:59.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,改用遠端 請見諒
Dialogue: 2,0:16:00.27,0:16:02.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好先進
Dialogue: 2,0:16:02.60,0:16:06.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪的媽媽幫我修好了洗衣機喔
Dialogue: 2,0:16:07.17,0:16:09.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,修理就交給媽媽吧
Dialogue: 2,0:16:09.80,0:16:11.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,咦！啊… 好
Dialogue: 2,0:16:13.17,0:16:17.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我家也是！祝她早日康復喔
Dialogue: 2,0:16:17.32,0:16:21.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對啦！把薑和蔥綁在脖子上很有效喔！
Dialogue: 2,0:16:21.87,0:16:25.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,把蔥插在屁股也是可以啦
Dialogue: 2,0:16:25.40,0:16:27.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那是迷信啦
Dialogue: 2,0:16:27.87,0:16:29.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,獲益良多！
Dialogue: 2,0:16:29.80,0:16:31.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,小雀學姊感冒了！
Dialogue: 2,0:16:31.60,0:16:34.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我現在就過… 咳咳！
Dialogue: 2,0:16:36.82,0:16:40.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,難道思兼小姐也感冒了嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:16:40.42,0:16:43.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對啊 常常的身體很差啊
Dialogue: 2,0:16:43.77,0:16:46.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,希望她能早點好起來啊
Dialogue: 2,0:16:48.85,0:16:51.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,為了讓常常早點恢復元氣
Dialogue: 2,0:16:51.25,0:16:53.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,準備了常常喜歡的東西！
Dialogue: 2,0:16:53.40,0:16:54.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 2,0:16:54.92,0:16:58.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪知道哪些治療感冒的方法嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:16:58.70,0:16:59.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,民俗療法中
Dialogue: 2,0:17:00.07,0:17:03.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,有種方法是“把蔥插入病患的肛門”
Dialogue: 2,0:17:03.77,0:17:05.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,喔！謝啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:17:06.05,0:17:07.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我畢竟是姊姊
Dialogue: 2,0:17:08.15,0:17:10.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,喔喔！蔥在哪裡！
Dialogue: 2,0:17:11.72,0:17:14.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,有夠吵的…
Dialogue: 2,0:17:15.40,0:17:19.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不過她的吵鬧在這種\N時候能讓我忘記病痛
Dialogue: 2,0:17:20.10,0:17:22.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這一點應該要給予肯定
Dialogue: 2,0:17:22.60,0:17:23.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,常常！
Dialogue: 2,0:17:27.15,0:17:28.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,瑪琪娜
Dialogue: 2,0:17:28.45,0:17:30.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,妳拿蔥站著幹嘛
Dialogue: 2,0:17:30.97,0:17:31.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,瑪琪娜？
Dialogue: 2,0:17:33.05,0:17:35.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,喂！住手… 呀！
Dialogue: 2,0:17:35.30,0:17:36.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好起來！
Dialogue: 2,0:17:40.60,0:17:41.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,再來…
Dialogue: 2,0:17:42.52,0:17:44.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,媽媽感冒了嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:17:44.60,0:17:46.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那真是讓人擔心呢
Dialogue: 2,0:17:47.27,0:17:48.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對 我很擔心
Dialogue: 2,0:17:49.52,0:17:53.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,田中！立刻叫來\N我們公司的醫療精英團隊
Dialogue: 2,0:17:53.92,0:17:56.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,已經完成治療了
Dialogue: 2,0:17:56.52,0:17:58.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那就不用了
Dialogue: 2,0:17:58.60,0:18:00.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,既然有吃藥和吃飯了
Dialogue: 2,0:18:00.65,0:18:02.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,再來只剩好好休息養病了
Dialogue: 2,0:18:03.87,0:18:06.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,雖然我能懂妳的擔心
Dialogue: 2,0:18:06.50,0:18:08.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,生病能得到阿爾瑪的照顧
Dialogue: 2,0:18:08.95,0:18:11.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,媽媽想必感到很開心喔
Dialogue: 2,0:18:12.12,0:18:15.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,開心？媽媽明明很難受
Dialogue: 2,0:18:15.65,0:18:18.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,有人在擔心自己
Dialogue: 2,0:18:18.62,0:18:20.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是開心的事喔
Dialogue: 2,0:18:20.52,0:18:21.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,以前我呀
Dialogue: 2,0:18:22.20,0:18:24.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,發高燒的時候
Dialogue: 2,0:18:24.22,0:18:27.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,田中也是一直全心照顧我呢
Dialogue: 2,0:18:27.70,0:18:29.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,總之要保重喔
Dialogue: 2,0:18:29.90,0:18:32.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我會帶很多花去探病的！
Dialogue: 2,0:18:32.97,0:18:34.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,小華 妮恩 謝謝妳們
Dialogue: 2,0:18:36.57,0:18:38.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,準備好資料了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.42,0:18:41.52,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（神里緣司 夜羽雀 阿爾瑪 研究室）
Dialogue: 2,0:18:40.22,0:18:41.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 2,0:18:43.42,0:18:44.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,單純是
Dialogue: 2,0:18:44.80,0:18:47.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,在意阿爾瑪一個人是不是真的沒問題
Dialogue: 2,0:18:48.12,0:18:49.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,才不是在擔心…
Dialogue: 2,0:18:53.62,0:18:55.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,怎… 麼回事
Dialogue: 2,0:18:56.37,0:18:57.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿… 阿爾瑪呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:19:01.50,0:19:02.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.75,0:19:04.35,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（好好吃蒟蒻凍 黃桃）
Dialogue: 2,0:19:04.87,0:19:06.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,臉色好很多了
Dialogue: 2,0:19:06.92,0:19:07.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 2,0:19:08.25,0:19:10.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我不太會做這些 幸好有妳
Dialogue: 2,0:19:11.30,0:19:12.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不是只有我
Dialogue: 2,0:19:13.42,0:19:15.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,大家教了我很多事
Dialogue: 2,0:19:16.50,0:19:17.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,所以才變這樣啊
Dialogue: 2,0:19:18.57,0:19:20.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,只有你們兩位的時候是怎麼做的呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:19:21.95,0:19:23.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,咦？那個嘛
Dialogue: 2,0:19:23.82,0:19:27.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那時候連睡覺的時間\N都用來製作阿爾瑪
Dialogue: 2,0:19:27.12,0:19:28.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,一直窩在屋子裡啊
Dialogue: 2,0:19:29.65,0:19:32.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,就算身體出狀況也是一直鬥嘴
Dialogue: 2,0:19:33.55,0:19:35.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,彼此都不坦率啊
Dialogue: 2,0:19:36.45,0:19:39.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,爸爸也在擔心媽媽呢
Dialogue: 2,0:19:39.57,0:19:42.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗄！我對她才沒有那樣…
Dialogue: 2,0:19:46.30,0:19:47.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 2,0:19:49.57,0:19:50.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沒事吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:19:52.70,0:19:53.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對啊
Dialogue: 2,0:19:54.95,0:19:56.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我也在擔心啊
Dialogue: 2,0:20:04.87,0:20:06.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,康復！
Dialogue: 2,0:20:06.85,0:20:09.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,太好了 要跟阿爾瑪道謝喔
Dialogue: 2,0:20:10.32,0:20:11.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,麻煩她了呢
Dialogue: 2,0:20:12.22,0:20:14.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,希望沒傳染給你們兩個
Dialogue: 2,0:20:14.82,0:20:17.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,笨蛋 阿爾瑪可是機器人欸！
Dialogue: 2,0:20:17.82,0:20:19.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,-怎麼可能感冒\N-哈啾
Dialogue: 2,0:20:26.37,0:20:27.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪！
Dialogue: 2,0:20:29.00,0:20:29.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,怎麼會！
Dialogue: 2,0:20:30.32,0:20:32.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,感染了病毒！
Dialogue: 2,0:20:32.42,0:20:33.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,有記錄了
Dialogue: 2,0:20:34.22,0:20:36.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是在取得醫療資療時中毒的！
Dialogue: 2,0:20:37.25,0:20:37.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好燙！
Dialogue: 2,0:20:38.55,0:20:41.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,等我一下 我馬上寫疫苗程式
Dialogue: 2,0:20:41.45,0:20:43.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,降溫！降溫！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.35,0:20:49.82,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（今天的阿爾瑪報告）
Dialogue: 2,0:20:43.52,0:20:47.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,得到了機器人也會感冒的重要資料
Dialogue: 2,0:20:47.30,0:20:48.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,早日康復喔
Dialogue: 2,0:22:20.20,0:22:21.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,探病
Dialogue: 2,0:22:21.77,0:22:22.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,贏了嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:22:23.15,0:22:24.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,輸掉了
Dialogue: 2,0:22:24.30,0:22:26.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,因為阿爾瑪不在
Dialogue: 2,0:22:26.27,0:22:29.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我們墮天使之翼以九比二慘敗了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.87,0:22:34.15,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（三吉  平井）
Dialogue: 2,0:22:30.07,0:22:31.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,輸給辣肉醬之劍
Dialogue: 2,0:22:32.10,0:22:34.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,畢竟有平井和三吉呀
Dialogue: 2,0:22:34.62,0:22:36.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,墮天使之翼這支隊伍
Dialogue: 2,0:22:36.17,0:22:39.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,原本曾經獨佔不敗墮天使的美名啊
Dialogue: 2,0:22:39.82,0:22:40.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真不甘心呢！
Dialogue: 2,0:22:41.25,0:22:42.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那只是躲避球啊
Dialogue: 2,0:22:43.00,0:22:44.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,正因為是躲避球啊！
Dialogue: 2,0:22:45.05,0:22:46.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,什麼鬼啊
Dialogue: 2,0:22:46.32,0:22:48.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪 明天一定要獲勝喔
Dialogue: 2,0:22:49.25,0:22:51.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好！我會盡快痊癒的！
Dialogue: 2,0:22:52.52,0:22:55.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,更何況明天的午餐是咖哩呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.87,0:22:58.37,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（塔希卡納3.5鮮乳）
Dialogue: 2,0:22:56.17,0:22:57.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真期待呢
Dialogue: 2,0:22:58.37,0:23:01.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對了！有東西要給阿爾瑪！
Dialogue: 2,0:23:01.82,0:23:03.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,給妳
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.35,0:23:05.65,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（焦糖布丁）
Dialogue: 2,0:23:03.35,0:23:05.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這是… 謝謝妳！
Dialogue: 2,0:23:06.17,0:23:08.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,今天的布丁猜拳非常激烈呢
Dialogue: 2,0:23:09.62,0:23:11.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,因為剩下三個
Dialogue: 2,0:23:11.62,0:23:14.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我為了阿爾瑪奮戰了喔！
Dialogue: 2,0:23:14.82,0:23:16.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,雖然想這麼說
Dialogue: 2,0:23:16.70,0:23:18.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,卻在最後輸掉了
Dialogue: 2,0:23:18.57,0:23:20.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那麼這個布丁是？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.20,0:23:23.00,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（津田）
Dialogue: 2,0:23:20.62,0:23:22.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是津田讓給妳的喔
Dialogue: 2,0:23:24.02,0:23:27.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,然後其他人就也想給阿爾瑪
Dialogue: 2,0:23:28.20,0:23:31.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,所以全班同學的布丁都在這裡喔
Dialogue: 2,0:23:32.15,0:23:34.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,哇啊 謝謝
Dialogue: 2,0:23:34.57,0:23:36.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我會全部吃掉 早點痊癒的
Dialogue: 2,0:23:36.62,0:23:37.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,呃 做不到吧
Dialogue: 2,0:23:38.50,0:23:39.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,結束
